# L §2.2 (writer 8): the built-ins latest and earliest are gone (the list names neither), and a call takes a built-in's
# name or a band's id (L §2.3 Calls): latest(d) names no band, LOAD-NAME.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input d: date

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d = window(2020-07-01, 2020-07-31)

ask q1: latest(d)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME ...
